[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0010","text":"────……\n啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0020","text":"辛苦啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0030","text":"辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0040","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0043","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0050","text":"────……是嗎～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0060","text":"────！\n什麼事……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0070","text":"這個掉在地上了哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0080","text":"……！謝謝您……\n這張收據要是弄丟了就沒有折扣了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0090","text":"────……！\n糟了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0100","text":"不好意思……我要去一趟超市……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0110","text":"真辛苦呢～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0120","text":"────辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0130","text":"您辛苦了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0139","text":"雏菜的母亲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0140","text":"……总有一天雏菜\n也会迎来那样的时刻吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0150","text":"嗯～？\n如果能像爸爸媽媽那樣就好了呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0159","text":"雏菜的父亲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0160","text":"不過，雛菜要是搬出去了會很寂寞啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0170","text":"欸～？\n雛菜不會搬出去哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0179","text":"雏菜的母亲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0180","text":"那样的话雏菜\n不是结不了婚了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0190","text":"每天來回就好啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0200","text":"……我先吃了\n姊姊的份我放冰箱裡…………好──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0210","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01890100_02_0220","text":"我开动了"}]
